{"title":"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_19\">Problem 19</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 19\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the equation of the tangent line to the curve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/e/bbe3822cbc0d75930955413489b3aec333c6b01a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\sqrt{x^{2}+5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"22\" /> at the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/876b66789c31005ef23e41081d8f7c10137faaa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/e/60e5c7b13a74d94a06c619d4ffbc44bc6bae6390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2x+3y = 13  \\quad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 3x+2y = 12  \\quad   \\quad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2x - y = 1  \\quad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 3x - 2y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"589\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the chain rule,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/0/7605e062a252ab9959f4ba68d18c60b9edb26c3a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y&#39; = \\frac{\\frac{d}{dx} \\left[ x^{2}+5 \\right]}{2 \\sqrt{x^{2}+5}} = \\frac{2x}{2\\sqrt{x^{2}+5}} = \\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^{2}+5}}\\]\" width=\"315\" height=\"45\" />\nWhen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, the slope is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/2/2a22a9dbe922f0d9f4ad6428a78f6181ef51cc99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39; = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2^{2}+5}} = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"145\" height=\"43\" />, so the tangent line is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b17519c47125342a7a9f99d1d3634d594bbafdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{2}{3}(x-2) + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" />. Multiplying by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and rearranging the terms, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/8/838399e72f50e12ab2647942615eeb03ddc7b1ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2x - 3y = -5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"155\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Blosp\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2026 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br />